  "criticalTechniques": [],
  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The ratio of egg to "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "dashi",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dashi"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is what makes or breaks "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "chawanmushi ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "chawanmushi"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". You want roughly 3 parts dashi to 1 part beaten egg by volume. The custard should wobble gently when you tap the cup. This dish was originally part of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "kaiseki",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "kaiseki"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " menus but is now everyday home cooking. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Strain the egg and dashi mixture through a fine sieve before pouring into cups. This removes chalazae strands and air bubbles that would cause an uneven texture."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
